3. СПЕЦИФИКАЦИЯ ДЛЯ CODEX (файлы/точки; НЕ трогать backend qaa-tms)
====================================================================

  AGENT (companion, FastAPI):
   1) agent/app/core/constants.py:
        - DEFAULT_LEONID_URL="https://leonid-prod.i.gc.onl" ;
          DEFAULT_LEONID_REQUEST_TIMEOUT=15.0 ;
          DEFAULT_LEONID_PRODUCTS = ("iam","storage","qaa","billing","cdn",
          "cloud","balancer","dns","streaming","notifications","waap")
          (реальные Product.name Leonid, lowercase; НЕ constants.Product).
        - EnvKey: LEONID_URL="AGENT_LEONID_URL",
          LEONID_PRODUCTS="AGENT_LEONID_PRODUCTS",
          LEONID_REQUEST_TIMEOUT="AGENT_LEONID_REQUEST_TIMEOUT".
        - AgentPath: LEONID_PRODUCTS="/leonid/products",
          LEONID_STATUS="/leonid/status", LEONID_REPORT="/leonid/report".
        - ErrorMessage: LEONID_UNREACHABLE, LEONID_NOT_CONFIGURED.
   2) agent/app/core/config.py: Settings += leonid_url (normalize_base_url,
      rstrip '/'), leonid_products (Annotated[list[str],NoDecode] + before-
      валидатор CSV/JSON как parse_jenkins_root_folders), leonid_request_timeout.
      Property leonid_configured = bool(leonid_url).
   3) agent/app/services/leonid.py (образец — jenkins.py агента): httpx.
      AsyncClient per-request, timeout=settings.leonid_request_timeout,
      follow_redirects=True. Классы LeonidNotConfiguredError / LeonidUnreachable
      Error. Функции:
        - async fetch_status(settings, product) -> dict|None (204 -> None).
        - async fetch_report(settings, product, start_date, end_date,
          environment|None, test_type|None) -> dict.
      Ошибки таймаута/HTTP -> LeonidUnreachableError(ErrorMessage.
      LEONID_UNREACHABLE); not configured -> LeonidNotConfiguredError. Логи —
      warning без тела ответа.
   4) agent/app/schemas: LeonidFailedStep, LeonidFailedTest, LeonidProductStatus
      (все поля Optional под факт-ответ; product добавляем на стороне агента),
      LeonidReportSummary (top_failed_tests: list[{name:str,count:int}]),
      LeonidProductsResponse {products: list[str], configured: bool}.
      (Опц. Р6/О5: leonid_url в AgentSettingsRead/Update + маппинг в routes.py
      AGENT_SETTINGS_ENV_KEY_BY_FIELD.)
   5) agent/app/api/routes.py: новые роуты (AuthDep, SettingsDep), паттерн
      обработки ошибок как jenkins-роуты (503 not-configured / 502 unreachable):
        - GET /leonid/products -> LeonidProductsResponse (кандидаты из settings
          + configured).
        - GET /leonid/status?product=... -> LeonidProductStatus; 204 -> 404
          (или пустой маркер, чтобы фронт скрыл продукт — согласовать с §Р4:
          вернуть 404 и фронт трактует как "нет данных").
        - GET /leonid/report?product=&start_date=&end_date=&environment=&
          test_type= -> LeonidReportSummary; валидация дат YYYY-MM-DD (400).
   6) agent/tests: httpx MockTransport; кейсы 200 / 204->скрытие / not-configured
      503 / unreachable 502 / парс дат.

  FRONTEND (React + Mantine + TanStack Query):
   7) src/constants.ts:
        - PluginId.LEONID="leonid".
        - IconName.LEONID (+ ICON_REGISTRY в core/plugins/icons.ts).
